{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Odd bridges at general L: localisation constants, L = 3 untwisting limits, mixed placements, homogeneous limit\n\nThread: ABJM su(4) alternating chain, one-field (odd-bridge, l = 1) structure constants from localising transfer-matrix words (NEXT.md 2i; `abjm-nongood-reference-limit.wb` did the 2-pair version). Sections: **1** closed forms of all localisation constants at general L (proof + exact checks at L = 2, 3 on three parameter sets including generic h and a generic BPS pair, numerical check at L = 4); **2** the two one-field families (F-site family (a), A-site family (b)) at L = 3: exact finite-twist localisation, twisted-eigenstate identity, untwisting limits against the saved HW states and the data-file C_1; **3** mixed placements (the same free rotation on pairs 2 and 3); **4** homogeneous limit and the normalised-t-hat form of the formula. Evidence tags: **[exact]** = Wolfram rational arithmetic in an executed cell (cells 1-14: sections 1 and the exact word identities of section 2); **[machine precision]** = executed Wolfram cell at machine precision (L = 4); **[numpy cross-check]** = result computed by an independent numpy implementation of the same vector actions and shown in the markdown cell under each Wolfram cell that could not be run (the Wolfram Engine licence expired during the session, see the last cell).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 0. Setup\n\nConventions (ABJM su(4) alternating chain, 2L sites A F A F ..., site 1 = A; see `README.md`, `ABJM-3pt-transfer-matrices.md` 2): bras are ROW vectors, an operator M acts on a bra as psi.M; A site: v -> v g, F site: u -> u g^-T; pairing v.u invariant, BPS pair v.u = 0. Lax L_s(u) = sum_ij e_ij (x) ((u - th_s) delta_ij + h rho_s(E_ij)), rho_A(E_ij) = e_ij, rho_F(E_ij) = -e_ji (so L_A = (u-th) + hK, L_F = (u-th) - hP on aux (x) site); monodromy T = L_1 ... L_2L with site 1 leftmost, DIAGONAL twist Lambda = diag(z) on the right, t1(u) = sum_i z_i T_ii. Dual transfer matrix tbar3 (needed only to select eigenvectors, as in `abjm-bridges.wb`): LbarA = (u - th + h) - h P, LbarF = (u - th - 3h) + h K, twist prod(z)/z.\n\n**Implementation.** `obApplyT[psi, th, z, u]` returns psi.t1(u) for a bra vector OR a matrix of bra rows, WITHOUT building any 4^N x 4^N operator: the auxiliary index is carried explicitly (4 slots), and each site acts by moving the amplitudes of local index a to local index b (`obIdx` = index lists). It works for exact rationals, machine numbers and symbols (2L = 2, 4 symbolic; 6 exact; 8 machine precision). All symbols of this notebook start with `ob`. Reference bras are products of identical BPS pairs (v, u), v.u = 0; the project's reference is W_a = (e1 + a e4) (x) (e4 - a e1), a = 1/3. h = 1/2.\n\nStandard point: th = (2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8, 5/13, -7/9, 4/15, -9/11) (first 2L entries), z = (3/2, 5/4, 2/3, 4/7).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "obh = 1/2;\nobTypes[Lp_] := Flatten[Table[{\"A\", \"F\"}, Lp]];\nobSetup[Lp_] := Module[{digs},\n   obLp = Lp; obNs = 2 Lp; obTy = obTypes[Lp];\n   digs = Tuples[Range[4], obNs]; obDigits = digs;\n   obIdx = Table[Table[Flatten[Position[digs[[All, s]], a]], {a, 4}], {s, obNs}];\n   Null];\nobE[i_] := UnitVector[4, i];\nobWv[a_] := {obE[1] + a obE[4], obE[4] - a obE[1]};\nobProd[sv_List] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct @@ sv];\nobRot[sv_List, s_, M_] := ReplacePart[sv, s -> sv[[s]] . M];\n(* psi.t1(u)  (bar -> tbar3(u)); psi = bra vector or matrix of bra rows; the aux index is carried in 4 slots X[[k]] *)\nobApplyT[psi_, th_List, z_List, u_, bar_: False, hh_: obh] := Module[{vec = (ArrayDepth[psi] == 1), P, zero, tw, res, X, Xn, x, c0, ty = obTy},\n   P = If[vec, {psi}, psi];\n   zero = ConstantArray[If[Precision[P] === Infinity, 0, 0. + 0. I], Dimensions[P]];\n   tw = If[bar, (Times @@ z)/z, z];\n   res = zero;\n   Do[X = Table[If[k == i, P, zero], {k, 4}];\n     Do[x = u - th[[s]];\n       c0 = x + If[bar, If[ty[[s]] == \"A\", hh, -3 hh], 0];\n       Xn = Table[c0 X[[kp]], {kp, 4}];\n       Do[If[! bar,\n          If[ty[[s]] == \"A\",\n            Xn[[kp, All, obIdx[[s, kp]]]] += hh X[[k, All, obIdx[[s, k]]]],\n            Xn[[kp, All, obIdx[[s, k]]]] += -hh X[[k, All, obIdx[[s, kp]]]]],\n          If[ty[[s]] == \"A\",\n            Xn[[kp, All, obIdx[[s, k]]]] += -hh X[[k, All, obIdx[[s, kp]]]],\n            Xn[[kp, All, obIdx[[s, kp]]]] += hh X[[k, All, obIdx[[s, k]]]]]],\n         {k, 4}, {kp, 4}];\n       X = Xn, {s, Length[ty]}];\n     res += tw[[i]] X[[i]], {i, 4}];\n   If[vec, First[res], res]];\nobSetup[2];\nGrid[{{\"pairs\", obLp}, {\"sites\", obNs}, {\"types\", obTy}, {\"dim\", 4^obNs}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725119\" data-output-id=\"236\" data-out-n=\"114\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"33\" data-sub-end=\"33\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[114]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"17\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtwYWlyc30gJiAyXFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtzaXRlc30gJiA0XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHt0eXBlc30gJiBcbGVmdFx7XHRleHR7QX0sXHRleHR7Rn0sXHRleHR7QX0sXHRleHR7Rn1ccmlnaHRcfVxcXGhsaW5lXHRleHR7ZGltfSAmIDI1NlxcXGhsaW5lXGVuZHthcnJheX0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.84em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pairs</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sites</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">types</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">F</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">F</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
