      {
       "data": "Out[123]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{L (pairs)} & \\text{c1 = closed form} & \\text{c12 = c2 = closed form} & \\text{c\\_2L = pair product}\\\\\\hline1 & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline2 & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline3 & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline4 & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline &  &  & \\\\\\hline\\text{L = 2 standard point} & \\text{c1, c2, c3, c4 =} & \\left\\{\\frac{603680}{25947},-\\frac{78694}{20925},-\\frac{321399232}{112262625},-\\frac{1108723}{174000}\\right\\} & \\\\\\hline\\text{quoted (task)} & \\text{c1 = 603680/25947, c3 = -321399232/112262625, c4 = -1108723/174000} & \\mathrm{True} & \\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "3ba3bbd3-8a89-4913-9e12-e0e3bc9bcb08"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1b. Exact verification of the chain constants (L = 2, 3) and numerical verification (L = 4)\n\n`obStepCheck[Lp, th, z, sv0]` builds the predecessors P_k as product states, applies the REAL transfer matrix t₁(θ_k) (vector action, no inversion: the inverse letters are tested through P_k . t₁(θ_k) = P_{k-1}/d_k) and extracts d_k as the component ratio. Columns: k, letter, d_k measured, d_k closed form, difference, residual of the whole vector y - r·(target) (exactly 0 = the vector IS the predicted product state; at machine precision the size of the numerical noise). Standard point, reference W_a^L with a = 1/3.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "obPredSV[sv0_List, z_List, k_] := Fold[obRot[#1, #2, If[OddQ[#2], DiagonalMatrix[1/z], DiagonalMatrix[z]]] &, sv0, Range[k]];\nobRefW[Lp_, a_] := Flatten[Table[obWv[a], Lp], 1];\nobStepCheck[Lp_, th_List, z_List, sv0_List, hh_: obh] := Module[{pred, n = 2 Lp},\n   pred[k_] := pred[k] = obProd[obPredSV[sv0, z, k]];\n   Table[Module[{y, tgt, j, r, dm, dc, dev},\n      {y, tgt} = If[OddQ[k], {obApplyT[pred[k], th, z, th[[k]], False, hh], pred[k - 1]}, {obApplyT[pred[k - 1], th, z, th[[k]], False, hh], pred[k]}];\n      j = First@Ordering[Abs[N[tgt]], -1];\n      r = y[[j]]/tgt[[j]]; dm = If[OddQ[k], 1/r, r]; dc = obD[k, th, Lp, hh];\n      dev = Flatten[y - r tgt];\n      {k, If[OddQ[k], \"A: inverse\", \"F: forward\"], dm, dc, dm - dc, If[Precision[dev] === Infinity, If[AllTrue[dev, # === 0 &], \"exactly 0\", \"NONZERO\"], Max[Abs[dev]]]}], {k, n}]];\nobStepGrid[rows_] := Grid[Prepend[rows, {\"k\", \"letter\", \"d_k measured\", \"d_k closed form\", \"difference\", \"vector residual\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left];\nobSetup[2];\nobT0 = AbsoluteTiming[obRowsL2 = obStepCheck[2, obTH[[;; 4]], obZ, obRefW[2, 1/3]];][[1]];\nColumn[{Row[{\"L = 2 (4 sites, dim 256), exact rationals, time \", obT0, \" s; cumulative c_k = \", FoldList[Times, obRowsL2[[All, 3]]]}], obStepGrid[obRowsL2]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
