      {
       "data": "Out[1910]= \\begin{matrix}\\text{L = 4 pairs, machine precision, standard point, time }43.7985309\\text{ s; max |d\\_k/closed - 1| = }4.974920113815485\\times 10^{-16}\\text{; max vector residual = }4.440892098500626\\times 10^{-16}\\text{; c\\_2L/(pair-product formula) - 1 = }-1.4432899320127035\\times 10^{-15}+0.\\,\\,\\mathrm{i}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{k} & \\text{letter} & \\text{d\\_k measured} & \\text{d\\_k closed form} & \\text{difference} & \\text{vector residual}\\\\\\hline1 & \\text{A: inverse} & 95.19157376462184 +0.\\,\\,\\mathrm{i} & 95.19157376462184 & 0.\\, +0.\\,\\,\\mathrm{i} & 3.903127820947816\\times 10^{-18}\\\\\\hline2 & \\text{F: forward} & -0.012525634247234243+0.\\,\\,\\mathrm{i} & -0.012525634247234243 & 0.\\, +0.\\,\\,\\mathrm{i} & 1.734723475976807\\times 10^{-18}\\\\\\hline3 & \\text{A: inverse} & 0.40432430207782755 +0.\\,\\,\\mathrm{i} & 0.40432430207782755 & 0.\\, +0.\\,\\,\\mathrm{i} & 2.220446049250313\\times 10^{-16}\\\\\\hline4 & \\text{F: forward} & 7.455242400537037 +0.\\,\\,\\mathrm{i} & 7.455242400537036 & 8.881784197001252\\times 10^{-16}+0.\\,\\,\\mathrm{i} & 4.440892098500626\\times 10^{-16}\\\\\\hline5 & \\text{A: inverse} & 14.179017733386095 +0.\\,\\,\\mathrm{i} & 14.179017733386091 & 3.552713678800501\\t… [latex truncated: 1836 chars total]",
