  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2a. Saved highest-weight states at L = 3 and the overlaps entering the limits\n\nLoad `data/abjm-hw-states.wxf`, key `L3` (26 untwisted, cyclic (pair shift S = 1), highest-weight joint eigenstates of tbar1, tbar3 at the ABJM point theta_A = theta_F + 2h, h = 1/2; `psi` = flat ket, site 1 most significant; overlap = bra . psi; `C` = (C_0 .. C_6), the project's bridge-l structure constants for the bra B_l of `abjm-LR-symmetry.wb`). Columns: weight, size of its weight sector (needed for the twisted eigenproblem), cyclicity defect, V0 = <vac^L|psi>, X11_p = <e1 e1 (pair p), vac elsewhere|psi>, X44_p = <e4 e4 (pair p), vac elsewhere|psi>, and C_1 from the file. Only the vacuum [3,0,3] (V0 = 1) and the three [2,0,2] states (weight (L-1)(e1 - e4)) see the one-field bridge; X11_p = X44_p = C_1 for all pairs p (cyclicity), so the mixed placements of section 3 have the same limits.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fixed 2026-10-13: do not Import the whole abjm-hw-states.wxf (its L4 key is 3 GB in memory); read the L3 states from the JSON export (same 26 states, same order) *)\nobHWpath = \"C:\\\\Users\\\\pryan\\\\git-projects\\\\abjm-c123\\\\Paul\\\\Mathematica\\\\su4-alternating\\\\checks\\\\session-2026-10-13\\\\epsexp\\\\hw_L3.json\";\nobHWraw = Import[obHWpath, \"RawJSON\"];\nobHW = Table[<|\"psi\" -> N[obHWraw[\"psiRe\"][[i]] + I obHWraw[\"psiIm\"][[i]]], \"dyn\" -> obHWraw[\"dyn\"][[i]], \"E\" -> obHWraw[\"E\"][[i]], \"w\" -> obHWraw[\"w\"][[i]],\n     \"C\" -> N[obHWraw[\"CRe\"][[i]] + I obHWraw[\"CIm\"][[i]]]|>, {i, Length[obHWraw[\"w\"]]}];\nobSetup[3];\nobWeight[b_] := Total[MapThread[If[#2 == \"A\", 1, -1] UnitVector[4, #1] &, {b, obTy}]];\nobSecIdx = GroupBy[Range[Length[obDigits]], obWeight[obDigits[[#]]] &];\nobVacSV = Flatten[Table[{obE[1], obE[4]}, 3], 1];\nobPairBra[p_, A_, F_] := obProd[ReplacePart[obVacSV, {2 p - 1 -> A, 2 p -> F}]];\nobVacBra = obProd[obVacSV];\nobShiftPair[psi_] := Flatten[Transpose[ArrayReshape[psi, {4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4}], {3, 4, 5, 6, 1, 2}]];\nobV0 = Table[obVacBra . st[\"psi\"], {st, obHW}];\nobX11 = Table[obPairBra[p, obE[1], obE[1]] . st[\"psi\"], {st, obHW}, {p, 3}];\nobX44 = Table[obPairBra[p, obE[4], obE[4]] . st[\"psi\"], {st, obHW}, {p, 3}];\nobChop[x_] := If[NumericQ[x], Chop[x, 10^-10], x];\nobStateRows = Table[{i, obHW[[i, \"dyn\"]], obHW[[i, \"w\"]], Length[obSecIdx[obHW[[i, \"w\"]]]], N[obHW[[i, \"E\"]], 6], ScientificForm[Max[Abs[obHW[[i, \"psi\"]] - obShiftPair[obHW[[i, \"psi\"]]]]], 2], obChop[obV0[[i]]], obChop /@ obX11[[i]], obChop /@ obX44[[i]], obChop[obHW[[i, \"C\"]][[2]]]}, {i, Length[obHW]}];\nGrid[Prepend[obStateRows, {\"#\", \"Dynkin\", \"weight\", \"sector dim\", \"E_MZ\", \"|psi - S psi|\", \"V0 = <vac^L|psi>\", \"X11_p, p=1,2,3\", \"X44_p, p=1,2,3\", \"C_1 (data)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725119\" data-output-id=\"240\" data-out-n=\"154\" data-sub-idx=\"16\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"15\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[154]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"17\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:32.44em;vertical-align:-15.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:16.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-18.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:18.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:32.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-15.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:16.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-18.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-17.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"