  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**[numpy cross-check of the cell above; the Wolfram cell was NOT run, see the status note at the end]** The 26 saved L = 3 states (the data file was read with a small WXF parser in numpy; psi normalised, cyclic to |psi - S psi| <= 7e-16, ket eigenvectors of t1/tbar3 with residual <= 5e-15). Only four rows are non-zero: the vacuum and the three [2,0,2] states (weight (2,0,0,-2) = (L-1)(e1 - e4)); for them X11_p = X44_p = C_1 for p = 1, 2, 3:\n\n| # | Dynkin | weight | sector dim | E_MZ | V0 | X11_p (p=1,2,3) | X44_p | C_1 (data) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | [3,0,3] | (3,0,0,-3) | 1 | 0 | 1 | 0,0,0 | 0,0,0 | 1 |\n| 2 | [4,0,0] | (3,-1,-1,-1) | 6 | 12 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |\n| 3, 4 | [1,2,1] | (2,1,-1,-2) | 9 | 12 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |\n| 5 | [2,0,2] | (2,0,0,-2) | 24 | 8 | 0 | 0.20412i (x3) | 0.20412i (x3) | 0.20412i |\n| 6 | [2,0,2] | (2,0,0,-2) | 24 | 8 | 0 | -0.20412i (x3) | -0.20412i (x3) | -0.20412i |\n| 7 | [2,0,2] | (2,0,0,-2) | 24 | 16 | 0 | 0.20412 (x3) | 0.20412 (x3) | 0.20412 |\n| 8-10 | [2,1,0] | (2,0,-1,-1) | 42 | 12 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |\n| 11 | [0,0,4] | (1,1,1,-3) | 6 | 12 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |\n| 12-14 | [0,1,2] | (1,1,0,-2) | 42 | 12 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |\n| 15, 16 | [0,2,0] | (1,1,-1,-1) | 72 | 24, 8 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |\n| 17-22 | [1,0,1] | (1,0,0,-1) | 141 | 10.34, 21.66, 23.54 (x2), 6.456 (x2) | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |\n| 23-26 | [0,0,0] | (0,0,0,0) | 256 | 18 (x2), 28.65, 3.351 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |\n\n0.204124 = 1/sqrt(24). So the odd bridge l = 1 at L = 3 sees exactly the vacuum and the three [2,0,2] states (R-charge rule |l - L| <= p with p = 2, parity L + p odd => l odd); the E_MZ = 8 pair are parity partners with C_1 = +-i/sqrt(24) (C_3 = C_5 = C_1), the E = 16 state has C_1 = C_3 = C_5 = 1/sqrt(24).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2b. Twisted eigenvectors and the finite-twist table\n\nThe deformation is theta = theta_ABJM + delta theta0 (theta0 = standard point), z = 1 + eps phi, delta = eps (section 4 varies delta independently). For each saved HW state the twisted eigenvector Psi_eps is the eigenvector, in the state's weight sector, of the mixed operator t1(0.3711) + 0.37 t1(-0.917) + 0.29 tbar3(0.41) - 0.13 tbar3(-0.77) (twisted, same combination as `abjm-bridges.wb`) with maximal overlap with the HW state; phase and norm: ||Psi_eps|| = 1, <Psi0|Psi_eps> > 0 (`ov` = |<Psi0|Psi_eps>|, `ov2` = the second largest overlap in the sector, to show the selection is unambiguous). The eigenvalues tau(theta_j), j = 1..6, are read off Psi_eps with the transfer matrices.\n\nTable columns: T_eps = <bra_eps|Psi_eps>/(eps (c + phi_x)) with bra_eps the localised product bra; `limit` = V0 + (a - a') X (F) or V0 + (a'' - a) X (A); LHS_prod = <bra_eps (product formula)|Psi_eps>, RHS_tau = (word eigenvalue) <W_a^L|Psi_eps> with the eigenvalues measured on Psi_eps (finite-twist identity, independent of the constants only through the closed forms of section 1).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "obPhi1f = N[obPhi1]; obPhi2f = N[obPhi2];\nobIds = {1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7};\n(* complex-valued unit vectors keep every array in obApplyT a uniform packed complex array (faster) *)\nobTauList[psi_, th_, z_, Lp_] := Module[{kk = First@Ordering[Abs[psi], -1], e},\n   e = N[UnitVector[Length[psi], kk]] + 0. I;\n   Table[(obApplyT[e, th, z, th[[j]]] . psi)/psi[[kk]], {j, 2 Lp}]];\nobTwisted[ids_List, th_List, z_List] := Module[{groups = GroupBy[ids, obHW[[#, \"w\"]] &], out = <||>},\n   KeyValueMap[Function[{w, ii}, Module[{idx = obSecIdx[w], B, M, vals, vecs, p0, ov, k, p, dd, full},\n       B = N[Table[UnitVector[Length[obDigits], i], {i, idx}]] + 0. I;\n       M = (obApplyT[B, th, z, 0.3711] + 0.37 obApplyT[B, th, z, -0.917] + 0.29 obApplyT[B, th, z, 0.41, True] - 0.13 obApplyT[B, th, z, -0.77, True])[[All, idx]];\n       {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[M]; vecs = Normalize /@ vecs;\n       Do[p0 = obHW[[i, \"psi\"]][[idx]]; ov = Abs[Conjugate[vecs] . p0]; k = First@Ordering[ov, -1];\n        p = vecs[[k]]; dd = Conjugate[p0] . p; p = p Abs[dd]/dd;\n        full = ConstantArray[0. + 0. I, Length[obDigits]]; full[[idx]] = p;\n        out[i] = <|\"psi\" -> full, \"ov\" -> ov[[k]], \"ov2\" -> If[Length[ov] > 1, Sort[ov, Greater][[2]], 0.], \"taus\" -> obTauList[full, th, z, obLp]|>, {i, ii}]]], groups];\n   out];\nobTwCache = <||>;\nobGetTw[name_, phi_, eps_, delta_] := Module[{key = {name, eps, delta}},\n   If[! KeyExistsQ[obTwCache, key], obTwCache[key] = obTwisted[obIds, N[obThABJM + delta obTH[[;; 2 obLp]]], 1. + eps phi]];\n   obTwCache[key]];\nobWordEig[taus_List, k_, al_, be_] := Product[If[OddQ[j], 1/taus[[j]], taus[[j]]], {j, 1, k - 1}] (al + be If[EvenQ[k], taus[[k]], 1/taus[[k]]]);\nobLimit[i_, k_, a_, cc_, phi_] := obV0[[i]] + With[{p = Ceiling[k/2]}, If[EvenQ[k], (a - a (cc + phi[[1]])/(cc + phi[[4]])) obX11[[i, p]], (a (cc + phi[[4]])/(cc + phi[[1]]) - a) obX44[[i, p]]]];\nobRow[i_, tw_, k_, a_, cc_, phi_, eps_, delta_] := Module[{Lp = obLp, th = N[obThABJM + delta obTH[[;; 2 obLp]]], z = 1. + eps phi, psi, bp, Wb, nrm, al, be, lhs, ovW, rhs, T, lim},\n   psi = tw[\"psi\"]; nrm = eps (cc + phi[[If[EvenQ[k], 4, 1]]]);\n   bp = obProd[obBraSV[Lp, N[a], z, k, cc, eps]]; Wb = obProd[obRefW[Lp, N[a]]];\n   {al, be} = obAlphaBeta[Lp, k, cc, eps, th];\n   lhs = bp . psi; ovW = Wb . psi; rhs = obWordEig[tw[\"taus\"], k, al, be] ovW;\n   T = lhs/nrm; lim = obLimit[i, k, a, cc, phi];\n   <|\"i\" -> i, \"k\" -> k, \"eps\" -> eps, \"ov\" -> tw[\"ov\"], \"ov2\" -> tw[\"ov2\"], \"ovW\" -> ovW, \"lhs\" -> lhs, \"rhs\" -> rhs, \"T\" -> T, \"lim\" -> lim, \"err\" -> Abs[T - lim], \"idres\" -> Abs[lhs - rhs], \"taus\" -> tw[\"taus\"]|>];\nobFmt[x_] := If[NumericQ[x], If[Abs[x] < 10^-13, 0, ScientificForm[Chop[x, 10^-14], 4]], x];\nobHdr = {\"family, k (pair)\", \"Dynkin\", \"E_MZ\", \"eps\", \"|<Psi0|Psi_eps>|\", \"2nd overlap\", \"<W|Psi_eps>\", \"T_eps\", \"limit\", \"|T_eps - limit|\", \"|LHS_prod - RHS_tau|\"};\nobRowGrid[r_] := {If[EvenQ[r[\"k\"]], \"F (a), \", \"A (b), \"] <> ToString[r[\"k\"]] <> \" (pair \" <> ToString[Ceiling[r[\"k\"]/2]] <> \")\", obHW[[r[\"i\"], \"dyn\"]], N[obHW[[r[\"i\"], \"E\"]]], r[\"eps\"], obFmt[r[\"ov\"]], obFmt[r[\"ov2\"]], obFmt[r[\"ovW\"]], obFmt[r[\"T\"]], obFmt[r[\"lim\"]], obFmt[r[\"err\"]], obFmt[r[\"idres\"]]};\nobEpsList = {0.01, 0.001, 0.0001};\nobStates = {1, 5, 6, 7, 2, 3};\nobT2 = AbsoluteTiming[obA1 = Table[Module[{tw = obGetTw[\"phi1\", obPhi1f, eps, eps]}, Table[obRow[i, tw[i], k, 1/3, 2., obPhi1f, eps, eps], {i, obStates}]], {k, {2, 1}}, {eps, obEpsList}];][[1]];\nColumn[{Row[{\"pair-1 families, phi1, c = 2, a = 1/3; time \", obT2, \" s\"}], Grid[Prepend[Map[obRowGrid, Flatten[obA1, 2]], obHdr], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
