  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Mixed placements: the one-field bridge on pair 2 and pair 3 (k = 3, 4, 5, 6)\n\nThe end-growing chain makes the first k - 1 sites carry the torus gamma and leaves the free one-parameter rotation on site k:\n\n- k = 3 (A site of pair 2): t₁(θ₁)⁻¹ t₁(θ₂) (α + β t₁(θ₃)⁻¹), α = 1/c₂, β = −κ/c₃;\n- k = 4 (F site of pair 2): t₁(θ₁)⁻¹ t₁(θ₂) t₁(θ₃)⁻¹ (α + β t₁(θ₄)), α = (cε − 1)/c₃, β = 1/c₄;\n- k = 5, 6: the same on pair 3 (c₄, c₅; c₅, c₆).\n\nBoth localise exactly (inverse-free identities of section 2, exact rational arithmetic, all six k). The limit bras have W_a on all pairs except pair p = ⌈k/2⌉ (the torus rotations on the other pairs tend to 1), and the HW shift with n = exp(−a E₁₄) gives V0 + (a − a') X11_p, resp. V0 + (a'' − a) X44_p, with X_p the pair-p overlaps of section 2a. By cyclicity of the saved states X_p does not depend on p, so on cyclic states the pair-2 and pair-3 words give the SAME limits as the pair-1 words (they differ at finite eps only by O(eps) because the torus factors on the earlier sites are not yet 1). Constants: the rotation matrices on site k are v(1 − κΛ⁻¹) (A) and u(cε − 1 + Λ) (F), i.e. exactly the pair-1 ones; what changes with p are the word coefficients α, β through c_{k-1}, c_k (table below).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "obA3 = Table[Module[{tw = obGetTw[\"phi1\", obPhi1f, eps, eps]}, Table[obRow[i, tw[i], k, 1/3, 2., obPhi1f, eps, eps], {i, obStates}]], {k, {3, 4, 5, 6}}, {eps, obEpsList}];\n(* all six placements at eps = 1e-4 (obA1[[1]] = k=2, obA1[[2]] = k=1; obA3[[k-2]] = k = 3..6): error to the limit and the finite-twist identity *)\nobPlacementRows = Table[With[{r = If[k <= 2, obA1[[If[k == 2, 1, 2], 3, si]], obA3[[k - 2, 3, si]]], i = obStates[[si]]},\n    {k, Ceiling[k/2], If[EvenQ[k], \"F (a)\", \"A (b)\"], obHW[[i, \"dyn\"]], N[obHW[[i, \"E\"]]], obFmt[r[\"T\"]], obFmt[r[\"lim\"]], obFmt[r[\"err\"]], obFmt[r[\"idres\"]]}], {k, 1, 6}, {si, 1, 4}];\nColumn[{Grid[Prepend[Map[obRowGrid, Flatten[obA3, 2]], obHdr], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[Prepend[Flatten[obPlacementRows, 1], {\"k\", \"pair p\", \"family\", \"Dynkin\", \"E_MZ\", \"T_eps (eps = 1e-4)\", \"limit\", \"|T - limit|\", \"|LHS_prod - RHS_tau|\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
