  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result of the cell above** (the exact values are the ones of the executed L = 3 table in section 1b; the symbolic factored forms are the formulas of section 1 at L = 3, h = 1/2, theta_ks = theta_k - theta_s, here written with h explicit):\n\n| k | letter | d_k (closed form) | d_k (standard point, exact) | c_k = d_1...d_k (exact) | c_k |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | A, t1(th_1)^-1 | 1/(h th_12 (th_13+h) th_14 (th_15+h) th_16) | 769088320/14100753 | 769088320/14100753 | 54.5424 |\n| 2 | F, t1(th_2) | -h th_21 th_23 th_25 (th_24-h)(th_26-h) | -131254/2559375 | -98037632/35049375 | -2.79713 |\n| 3 | A, t1(th_3)^-1 | 1/(h th_32 (th_31+h) th_34 (th_35+h) th_36) | 8441649216/14063580305 | -3170878541422592/1888581225871875 | -1.67897 |\n| 4 | F, t1(th_4) | -h th_41 th_43 th_45 (th_42-h)(th_46-h) | 281897043/65601536 | -31678268356273/4390772975000 | -7.21474 |\n| 5 | A, t1(th_5)^-1 | 1/(h th_52 (th_51+h) th_54 (th_53+h) th_56) | 28589561/2712792 | -873353698694345869/11486262102600000 | -76.0346 |\n| 6 | F, t1(th_6) | -h th_61 th_63 th_65 (th_62-h)(th_64-h) | -10352371/168880140 | 6333341157664592071/1358814566556000000 | 4.66093 |\n\nc_6 = (h^2 - th_24^2)(h^2 - th_26^2)(h^2 - th_46^2)/((h^2 - th_13^2)(h^2 - th_15^2)(h^2 - th_35^2)) = the global-torus constant (verified exactly above); c_2 = c_12 = th_23 th_25 (th_24-h)(th_26-h)/((th_13+h)(th_15+h) th_14 th_16). At L = 2 (standard point): c_1 = 603680/25947, c_2 = c_12 = -78694/20925, c_3 = -321399232/112262625, c_4 = -1108723/174000 (executed, section 1).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
