  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**[numpy cross-check of the cell above; the Wolfram cell was NOT run]** delta-scan at eps = 1e-3 (F-site family, pair 1, phi1, c = 2, a = 1/3; theta = theta_ABJM + delta theta0). c_1 -> 8, d_2 -> 1/8 (finite at delta = 0), T_eps varies smoothly with delta and has a regular value at delta = 0 exactly; the remaining |T - limit| = O(eps) (the limit is the eps -> 0 one, section 2); at delta = 0.1 the twisted eigenvector has overlap 0.993 with the HW state, so the O(delta) deviation of T is visible:\n\n| delta | c1 | d2 | state (E) | |<Psi0|Psi_eps>| | hat tau_1 | hat tau_2 | T_eps | limit |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 0.1 | 6.3745 | 0.137978 | [2,0,2] (8) | 0.993286 | -0.0087+1.0035i | -0.0138+1.0594i | -0.024883-0.14549i | -0.151203i |\n| 0.1 | 6.3745 | 0.137978 | [2,0,2] (16) | 0.990530 | -1.00547 | -1.12369 | -0.143069 | -0.151203 |\n| 0.01 | 7.80234 | 0.126587 | [2,0,2] (8) | 0.999934 | -8.8e-5+1.0009i | -1.2e-4+1.0051i | -0.0026139-0.15061i | -0.151203i |\n| 0.01 | 7.80234 | 0.126587 | [2,0,2] (16) | 0.999908 | -1.00118 | -1.0109 | -0.150325 | -0.151203 |\n| 1e-3 | 7.97982 | 0.125161 | [2,0,2] (8) | 0.999999 | 1.0006i | 0.99985i | -0.00034563-0.15089i | -0.151203i |\n| 1e-3 | 7.97982 | 0.125161 | [2,0,2] (16) | 0.999999 | -1.00066 | -1.00043 | -0.150863 | -0.151203 |\n| 1e-6 | 7.99998 | 0.125 | [2,0,2] (8) | 1.000000 | 1.0006i | 0.99927i | -9.3428e-05-0.15092i | -0.151203i |\n| 1e-6 | 7.99998 | 0.125 | [2,0,2] (16) | 1.000000 | -1.0006 | -0.999272 | -0.150921 | -0.151203 |\n| 0 (homogeneous) | 8 | 0.125 | [2,0,2] (8) | 1.000000 | 1.0006i | 0.99927i | -9.3176e-05-0.15092i | -0.151203i |\n| 0 | 8 | 0.125 | [2,0,2] (16) | 1.000000 | -1.0006 | -0.999271 | -0.150921 | -0.151203 |\n\n(The state E = 8 partner with C_1 = -i/sqrt(24) is the complex conjugate; the vacuum row is T = 0.999101 hat tau_1 = z_1, hat tau_2 = z_4 for every delta.) The continuity in delta is shown by T_eps(delta = 1e-2, 1e-3, 1e-6, 0) = -0.00261-0.15061i, -0.000346-0.15089i, -9.34e-5-0.15092i, -9.32e-5-0.15092i for the E = 8 state.",
